  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NRDDB Project Together We Rise: Empo Indige Women</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project &apos;Together We Rise: Empowering Indigenous Women and Girls in Region 9&apos; led by the Makushi Research Unit, aims to empower indigenous women and girls in southern Guyana by promoting gender equality, combating gender-based violence (GBV), and enhancing economic and social opportunities. The project will facilitate six workshops to over 400 participants across the region, focusing on domestic and GBV, capacity building, and youth issues</narrative>
  </description>
